WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.430
(bright music)

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.273
- Are you a snack?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.290
Because I just can't get enough of you!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.723
I'm so bloated with love.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.990
- Hey, cupcake, you'd look a lot sweeter

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.673
if you smiled a little.

00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:21.278
(scratching)

00:00:22.157 --> 00:00:22.990
(crunch)

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:23.823
(giggle)

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:24.656
It's me!

00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:25.595
(ding)

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.280
It is very important to dress
for the job that you want.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.530
That's why I wear nothing!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.933
Because I don't want a job.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.500
Then you have to do
actual work, (beep) that!

00:00:37.732 --> 00:00:40.065
I'm the good advice cupcake!

00:00:40.947 --> 00:00:43.723
Sometimes when life gets you down,

00:00:45.071 --> 00:00:45.947
(grunt)

00:00:45.947 --> 00:00:50.187
you gotta grab it by the balls
and make life your bitch.

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:53.790
(tense music)

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:54.623
Hello!

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.420
A lot of you have been asking
about my makeup routine,

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:01.253
so I'm finally gonna
share my beauty secrets.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.680
What you'll need is one cup of flour

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.023
and one stick of butter.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.980
Step one, you're gonna take the flour

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:09.670
and start highlighting all
the best parts of your face.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:14.270
So like here, and here, and
I'm mean, your whole face

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.060
is really cute, so
basically the whole thing.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.940
Step two, now we're gonna
take the stick of butter

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.823
and just rub it all over,
especially around your mouth,

00:01:24.895 --> 00:01:26.271
(slurping)

00:01:26.271 --> 00:01:28.191
'cause it tastes so good.

00:01:28.191 --> 00:01:30.047
(crunching)

00:01:30.047 --> 00:01:32.820
And finally, for the most important step

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.583
to true beauty and inner glow, take a nap.

00:01:36.655 --> 00:01:39.914
I feel so (beep) pretty.

00:01:39.914 --> 00:01:42.081
(snoring)

